# The pinned j3c release that seeds ./build.sh when no installed j3c is new enough (plan 15, seed option c).
# Read by tools/seed.sh (download + sha256 check) and build.sh (an installed j3c must be at least this version).
#
# To pin a release, cut it with tools/release/package.sh (repo root), upload its dist/ files to the GitHub
# release v<version> (assets j3c-<version>-<arch>-linux.tar.gz and SHA256SUMS), then set:
#   version 0.2.0
#   sha256 x86_64 <sha256 of j3c-0.2.0-x86_64-linux.tar.gz, from that SHA256SUMS>
#   sha256 aarch64 <...>
# A sha256 line is required for the arch seed.sh runs on. `version unset` means no J3 release exists yet
# (v0.1.0 is the old Rust compiler and cannot build this tree).
version unset
